{"name": "s2", "dur": 90.16, "lines": [{"id": "b01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.51, "clip": 0.29, "text": "你刷的每条视频，", "ch": [0.35, 0.495, 0.64, 0.785, 0.93, 1.075, 1.22, 1.365], "sub": null, "big": "你刷的每条视频，", "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b02", "t0": 1.91, "t1": 3.43, "clip": 1.83, "text": "都是一串 0 和 1。", "ch": [1.91, 2.048, 2.186, 2.325, 2.463, 2.601, 2.739, 2.877, 3.015, 3.154, 3.292], "sub": null, "big": "都是一串 0 和 1。", "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b03", "t0": 3.83, "t1": 8.68, "clip": 3.77, "text": "可在线上，没有一个个分开的 0 和 1：连续五个 1，就是一条直线。", "ch": [3.83, 4.23, 4.63, 5.03, 5.43, 5.95, 5.97, 5.99, 6.01, 6.03, 6.05, 6.07, 6.09, 6.11, 6.13, 6.15, 6.17, 6.19, 6.21, 6.23, 6.4, 6.594, 6.789, 6.983, 7.177, 7.371, 7.566, 7.87, 7.986, 8.101, 8.217, 8.333, 8.449, 8.564], "sub": "连续五个 1，就是一条直线", "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b03b", "t0": 8.93, "t1": 12.08, "clip": 8.87, "text": "是四个，还是五个？数错一个，数据就错了。", "ch": [8.93, 9.088, 9.245, 9.402, 9.56, 9.717, 9.875, 10.032, 10.19, 10.348, 10.505, 10.662, 10.82, 10.978, 11.135, 11.293, 11.45, 11.607, 11.765, 11.922], "sub": "四个还是五个？数错一个就全错", "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b03c", "t0": 12.33, "t1": 17.2, "clip": 12.27, "text": "AI 芯片之间每秒要这样数上千亿个，还没人告诉它节拍。它怎么数清？", "ch": [12.33, 12.474, 12.619, 12.763, 12.908, 13.052, 13.197, 13.341, 13.486, 13.63, 13.774, 13.919, 14.063, 14.208, 14.352, 14.497, 14.641, 14.786, 15.09, 15.217, 15.343, 15.47, 15.597, 15.723, 15.85, 15.977, 16.103, 16.4, 16.533, 16.667, 16.8, 16.933, 17.067], "sub": "没人告诉它节拍，怎么数清？", "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b04", "t0": 17.65, "t1": 21.75, "clip": 17.58, "text": "芯片之间的高速数据，是排成一列、一个接一个送过去的。", "ch": [17.65, 17.814, 17.978, 18.142, 18.306, 18.47, 18.634, 18.798, 18.962, 19.126, 19.39, 19.542, 19.693, 19.845, 19.997, 20.148, 20.44, 20.571, 20.702, 20.833, 20.964, 21.095, 21.226, 21.357, 21.488, 21.619], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b05", "t0": 22.0, "t1": 25.54, "clip": 21.91, "text": "发货端把并排的数据排成一列，以极快的节奏送上路。", "ch": [22.0, 22.149, 22.299, 22.448, 22.597, 22.746, 22.896, 23.045, 23.194, 23.344, 23.493, 23.642, 23.791, 23.941, 24.19, 24.325, 24.46, 24.595, 24.73, 24.865, 25.0, 25.135, 25.27, 25.405], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L21"}, {"id": "b06", "t0": 25.79, "t1": 28.61, "clip": 25.73, "text": "今天一条通道，每秒要送出上千亿个比特。", "ch": [25.79, 25.921, 26.053, 26.184, 26.316, 26.447, 26.579, 26.81, 26.96, 27.11, 27.26, 27.41, 27.56, 27.71, 27.86, 28.01, 28.16, 28.31, 28.46], "sub": "一条通道，每秒上千亿个比特", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L22"}, {"id": "b07", "t0": 29.06, "t1": 31.22, "clip": 29.01, "text": "把这一秒放大，再放大，再放大，", "ch": [29.06, 29.184, 29.309, 29.433, 29.557, 29.681, 29.806, 30.12, 30.247, 30.375, 30.502, 30.75, 30.867, 30.985, 31.102], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L23"}, {"id": "b08", "t0": 31.47, "t1": 35.32, "clip": 31.41, "text": "才看得见一个个比特：这一秒里，有上千亿个这样的比特。", "ch": [31.47, 31.596, 31.722, 31.848, 31.974, 32.1, 32.226, 32.352, 32.478, 32.604, 32.91, 33.04, 33.17, 33.3, 33.43, 33.76, 33.902, 34.044, 34.185, 34.327, 34.469, 34.611, 34.753, 34.895, 35.036, 35.178], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L24"}, {"id": "b09", "t0": 35.77, "t1": 39.26, "clip": 35.71, "text": "到了收货端，再把这一列重新拆开，并排放回芯片里。", "ch": [35.77, 36.147, 36.523, 36.9, 37.277, 37.653, 38.14, 38.175, 38.21, 38.245, 38.28, 38.315, 38.35, 38.385, 38.42, 38.455, 38.59, 38.674, 38.758, 38.841, 38.925, 39.009, 39.093, 39.176], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L25"}, {"id": "b10", "t0": 39.51, "t1": 44.58, "clip": 39.46, "text": "这里有个容易被忽略的难处：信号里的 0 和 1，并不是一件件分开的包裹。", "ch": [39.51, 39.664, 39.817, 39.971, 40.125, 40.278, 40.432, 40.585, 40.739, 40.893, 41.046, 41.2, 41.354, 41.507, 41.619, 41.731, 41.842, 41.954, 42.066, 42.178, 42.289, 42.401, 42.513, 42.625, 42.736, 42.89, 43.044, 43.197, 43.351, 43.505, 43.658, 43.812, 43.965, 44.119, 44.273, 44.426], "sub": "0 和 1 不是分开的包裹", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L26"}, {"id": "b11", "t0": 45.03, "t1": 49.32, "clip": 44.97, "text": "比如连续五个 1，到了收货端，就是一段连在一起、没有缝隙的高电平。", "ch": [45.03, 45.149, 45.268, 45.388, 45.507, 45.626, 45.745, 45.864, 45.983, 46.103, 46.237, 46.371, 46.505, 46.639, 46.773, 46.907, 47.041, 47.175, 47.309, 47.443, 47.577, 47.711, 47.845, 47.979, 48.113, 48.248, 48.382, 48.516, 48.65, 48.784, 48.918, 49.052, 49.186], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L27"}, {"id": "b12", "t0": 49.77, "t1": 53.89, "clip": 49.72, "text": "要数清这里有几个 1，就得知道每个比特占多长时间，这就是“节拍”。", "ch": [49.77, 49.887, 50.004, 50.121, 50.238, 50.355, 50.472, 50.589, 50.706, 50.823, 50.94, 51.058, 51.186, 51.315, 51.444, 51.573, 51.701, 51.83, 51.959, 52.088, 52.216, 52.345, 52.474, 52.603, 52.731, 52.86, 52.989, 53.118, 53.246, 53.375, 53.504, 53.633, 53.761], "sub": "每个比特占多长时间 = 节拍", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L28"}, {"id": "b13", "t0": 54.14, "t1": 55.82, "clip": 54.09, "text": "只看高低，是数不清的。", "ch": [54.14, 54.298, 54.456, 54.614, 54.772, 55.05, 55.178, 55.307, 55.435, 55.563, 55.692], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L29"}, {"id": "b14", "t0": 56.27, "t1": 63.68, "clip": 56.21, "text": "这类高速连接，通常不另外送一个节拍器过去，而是让收货端从信号高低变化的节奏里，自己推算出节拍，", "ch": [56.27, 56.407, 56.544, 56.681, 56.819, 56.956, 57.093, 57.36, 57.503, 57.646, 57.789, 57.931, 58.074, 58.217, 58.36, 58.503, 58.646, 58.789, 58.931, 59.074, 59.217, 59.54, 59.692, 59.843, 59.995, 60.147, 60.298, 60.45, 60.602, 60.753, 60.905, 61.057, 61.208, 61.36, 61.512, 61.663, 61.815, 61.967, 62.118, 62.54, 62.683, 62.825, 62.968, 63.11, 63.253, 63.395, 63.538], "sub": "不送节拍器，从跳变里推算节拍", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L30"}, {"id": "b15", "t0": 63.93, "t1": 68.9, "clip": 63.87, "text": "所以发出去之前，数据还会先被打乱一下，让高低变化够多，节拍才一直听得出来。", "ch": [63.93, 64.064, 64.199, 64.333, 64.467, 64.602, 64.736, 64.87, 65.005, 65.139, 65.273, 65.408, 65.542, 65.676, 65.811, 65.945, 66.079, 66.214, 66.348, 66.482, 66.616, 66.751, 66.885, 67.019, 67.154, 67.288, 67.422, 67.557, 67.691, 67.825, 67.96, 68.094, 68.228, 68.363, 68.497, 68.631, 68.766], "sub": "先打乱，让高低变化够多", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b16", "t0": 69.15, "t1": 70.93, "clip": 69.09, "text": "再按节拍，一个一个地清点。", "ch": [69.15, 69.296, 69.442, 69.588, 69.734, 69.99, 70.108, 70.225, 70.343, 70.46, 70.578, 70.695, 70.813], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L31"}, {"id": "b17", "t0": 71.18, "t1": 74.4, "clip": 71.06, "text": "业内把这一步叫时钟数据恢复，简称 CDR。", "ch": [71.18, 71.334, 71.487, 71.641, 71.794, 71.948, 72.101, 72.255, 72.409, 72.562, 72.716, 72.869, 73.023, 73.176, 73.46, 73.594, 73.729, 73.863, 73.997, 74.131, 74.266], "sub": "时钟数据恢复 CDR", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b18", "t0": 74.65, "t1": 79.74, "clip": 74.6, "text": "这就是理解 SerDes 的基本框架：发出去时排成一列，收进来时听准节拍、拆回一排。", "ch": [74.65, 74.764, 74.878, 74.992, 75.105, 75.219, 75.333, 75.447, 75.561, 75.675, 75.789, 75.902, 76.016, 76.13, 76.244, 76.358, 76.472, 76.586, 76.699, 76.813, 76.941, 77.068, 77.195, 77.322, 77.45, 77.577, 77.704, 77.831, 77.959, 78.086, 78.213, 78.34, 78.468, 78.595, 78.722, 78.849, 78.977, 79.104, 79.231, 79.358, 79.486, 79.613], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L32"}, {"id": "b19", "t0": 80.19, "t1": 80.94, "clip": 80.13, "text": "一句话带走。", "ch": [80.19, 80.315, 80.44, 80.565, 80.69, 80.815], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "L46"}, {"id": "b20", "t0": 81.19, "t1": 84.93, "clip": 81.13, "text": "SerDes 发出时排队，收到时先听准节拍，再拆回一排。", "ch": [81.19, 81.224, 81.258, 81.292, 81.325, 81.359, 81.393, 81.427, 81.461, 81.495, 81.528, 81.562, 81.596, 81.76, 81.848, 81.936, 82.023, 82.111, 82.199, 82.287, 82.374, 82.462, 82.7, 83.072, 83.443, 83.815, 84.187, 84.558], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "L48"}, {"id": "b21", "t0": 85.18, "t1": 88.56, "clip": 85.12, "text": "下一条：一颗芯片号称跑得快，该问它哪三个问题？", "ch": [85.18, 85.278, 85.375, 85.473, 85.69, 85.846, 86.002, 86.158, 86.314, 86.47, 86.626, 86.782, 86.938, 87.094, 87.36, 87.493, 87.627, 87.76, 87.893, 88.027, 88.16, 88.293, 88.427], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "新增"}], "shots": [{"kind": "scope", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "b01", "t1": 17.35}, {"kind": "stream", "t0": 17.35, "paper": false, "first": "b04", "t1": 28.76}, {"kind": "zoom", "t0": 28.76, "paper": false, "first": "b07", "t1": 35.47}, {"kind": "unpack", "t0": 35.47, "paper": false, "first": "b09", "t1": 44.73}, {"kind": "desk", "t0": 44.73, "paper": true, "first": "b11", "strips": [{"id": "O5", "line": "b11", "from": "连续", "to": "1"}, {"id": "O6", "line": "b11", "from": "就是", "to": "一起"}, {"id": "O7", "line": "b11", "from": "没有", "to": "电平"}], "t1": 49.47}, {"kind": "level", "t0": 49.47, "paper": false, "first": "b12", "t1": 55.97}, {"kind": "cdr", "t0": 55.97, "paper": false, "first": "b14", "t1": 79.89}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 79.89, "paper": true, "first": "b19", "strips": [{"id": "E0", "line": "b19", "from": null, "to": null}, {"id": "E3", "line": "b20", "from": "SerDes", "to": "排队"}, {"id": "E4", "line": "b20", "from": "收到", "to": "听准"}, {"id": "E5", "line": "b20", "from": "节拍", "to": "一排"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 90.16}], "hudIn": 17.35}